==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*gʷʰer-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*goře}}. Akin to {{m|ru|горе́ть||to burn, to be consumed by fire}}.

Compare typologically {{m|ru|печа́ль}} (akin to {{m|ru|печь||to bake}}).

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|го́ре|pos=n}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-горе.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|го́ре|dim=го́рюшко<q:endearing>}}

# {{lb|ru|usually|uncountable}} [[grief]], [[distress]], [[sadness]]
# {{lb|ru|usually|uncountable}} [[trouble]]
# {{lb|ru|usually|uncountable}} [[misfortune]], [[disaster]]

